	)
	(text "RC snubbers: all DNP. Tune from measured ringing; verify resistor pulse/average power.\nReturn each RC to the local MOSFET PGND power pad BEFORE the shunt.\nGL/SOURCE pads measure low-side Vgs; PHASE is a switching node."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 177.8 0)
		(effects
